ural venue in the city's music scene.|basic_html|About Aby's Rapid CityDating back to the early 1900s this family-owned grain mill has been transformed into Rapid City's premier live music venue beer bar and wine bar. The beautifully designed space showcases the building's historic architecture while creating an inviting atmosphere for music art and community gathering.The VenueAby's features both indoor and outdoor spaces with 12 beer taps highlighting local craft breweries a curated wine selection and a rotating art gallery. The venue hosts a weekly Jazz Brunch on Sundays featuring local jazz artists and breakfast foods. Open Wednesday through Saturday evenings the space welcomes a diverse crowd for music trivia bingo and special events.Music ProgrammingBeyond open mic Wednesdays Aby's hosts live music Thursday through Saturday nights featuring local and regional bands. The venue has become a central hub for entertainment in downtown Rapid City with regular concerts DJ performances and poetry nights. Recent partnerships with Elevate Rapid City and the Downtown Innovation District have positioned Aby's as a key cultural venue in the city's music scene.","44.081793585473|-103.22274548778||44.081793585473, -103.22274548778",,,"In Person",,901|node|736f4444-3e05-461d-94db-eb6d8b877a85|/abys-rapid-city,"Aby's Rapid City",
