ncing and live music.Live Music & EntertainmentThe venue features live music Thursday through Saturday nights with a mix of country rock and various genres. The historic sawdust-covered dance floor invites guests to two-step the night away. Monday nights feature jazz musicians and the venue hosts regular open mic nights on Wednesdays.Dining ExperienceThe Western Horseman offers full-service dining with a menu featuring steaks burgers and other American cuisine. The restaurant serves brunch on weekends and maintains a full bar with craft cocktails. The venue is located inside the Cactus Cove Inn and Suites.","35.194690263666|-101.80752617042||35.194690263666, -101.80752617042","Colten Witcher",,"In Person",,864|node|3968a34c-1cf5-469a-a58c-28e14778078f|/western-horseman-club,"The Western Horseman Club",
