 Lumberyard opened in Canyon Texas in May 2024 as a premier concert venue and restaurant. Located just 20 minutes from downtown Amarillo this modern facility combines dining entertainment and community gathering spaces in a revitalized property.Live Music & EventsThe venue hosts major concerts throughout the year featuring Texas country Red Dirt Americana and rock acts. Thursday nights feature karaoke while Friday nights bring live music on the weeknights. The outdoor concert space and indoor restaurant create versatile entertainment options year-round.Dining ExperienceThe restaurant opened in March 2025 with a full menu and bar service. The venue features a 36000 square-foot patio and banquet facilities that can accommodate up to 3300 guests. A wall of self-serve beer taps offers variety and the kitchen serves diverse cuisine.Community ImpactAs part of Canyon's growth The Lumberyard represents a significant investment in the community. The venue hosts everything from intimate songwriter nights to large-scale festivals. The property was developed on former lumberyard land transforming unused space into a cultural hub.","34.99205084571|-101.91768347785||34.99205084571, -101.91768347785",,,"In Person",,867|node|16294a6b-da2e-4fba-899d-5216ba745899|/lumberyard,"The Lumberyard",
