ate atmosphere perfect for experiencing live music.Music ProgrammingThe venue hosts Open Mic Night every Monday with signups at 6:00 PM and performances starting around 7:00 PM. Musicians and comedians are welcome. Throughout the week Vultures features live bands across multiple genres including rock indie punk and alternative. The venue has a capacity of 150 and is known for its excellent sound system and friendly staff.Atmosphere and AmenitiesThe walls are decorated with old posters and knickknacks including quirky details like a tiny skateboard and disco ball. The venue serves drinks and comfort food with fair prices. All ages are welcome making it accessible to the entire community. Happy hour runs from 4:00 PM to 6:00 PM daily.","38.837409769814|-104.78956012397||38.837409769814, -104.78956012397","Joe Bruno",,"In Person from 6:00 PM",,851|node|a0d8bfb0-984d-4058-b6f6-8cc83c9d4e47|/vultures,Vultures,
