esday night Kinfolks hosts an open mic starting at 7:30 PM hosted by Ramsey. The venue also showcases local and national musical acts on their stage throughout the week. The intimate setting creates a perfect atmosphere for both performers and audience members to enjoy quality music in a relaxed environment.Venue DetailsThe venue is closed on Mondays and Sundays but open Tuesday through Saturday. They accept credit cards and reservations. The outdoor patio is dog-friendly. Kinfolks has become a favorite gathering spot for music lovers and craft beer enthusiasts in the Pikes Peak region.","38.859341060377|-104.91842776814||38.859341060377, -104.91842776814",Ramsey,,"In Person",,852|node|74b7fea0-e62c-4036-9593-1eba98f5e2f1|/kinfolks,Kinfolks,
