utifully renovated 119-year-old brick building houses a taproom with 18 beers brewed on-site plus guest taps for cider and mead. The venue features an inviting patio space and turfed backyard perfect for large groups with plenty of shade.Music and EventsThe brewery hosts weekly Sunday open mic nights and various live music events throughout the week. Located just steps from the iconic Florida Theatre and Elbow District making it a popular pre-show destination. The resident food truck Ruby Beach Smoke serves delicious bites seven days a week.AtmosphereRuby Beach offers a higher-end industrial styled brewery with both indoor and outdoor seating options. The space is family and dog-friendly with ample parking. The venue also hosts weddings ceremonies corporate events and private celebrations in their event spaces including The Lawn The Lounge and The 2nd Floor.","30.326227546908|-81.654071860326||30.326227546908, -81.654071860326","Torin Ance",,"In Person from 6:30 PM",,757|node|c52c7897-a9d7-4322-b85c-ee31870e28a2|/ruby-beach-brewing,"Ruby Beach Brewing",
