hout creating a welcoming atmosphere for performers and audiences alike.Music and EventsBeyond the Wednesday open mic the venue hosts Comedy Night and Karaoke events. The open mic night is known for its soul and deep profound atmosphere that balances loose fun with heartfelt performance. Host Trikstah sets an amazing tone with spoken word poetry modern R&B singing and pep talks on the transformative power of performing arts.Food and DrinkThe venue offers a Miami-themed menu and features a serve-yourself drinks cooler. The casual atmosphere combines great food with a commitment to supporting local artists and creating community.","25.773350261801|-80.222987394436||25.773350261801, -80.222987394436",Trikstah,,"In Person from 8:30 PM",,741|node|44334fc3-a45e-425a-8699-d05a603583ab|/thank-you-miami-cocina-beerhouse,"Thank You Miami Cocina & Beerhouse",
