o Sports Bar & Club in Sunnyvale is a lively venue that has become the current home for one of the South Bay's most respected blues jam sessions. The venue offers a full bar sports viewing and a welcoming atmosphere for both musicians and music fans.The Monday Blues JamEvery Monday from 8-11 PM the venue hosts a pro-level blues jam led by Dennis Dove and his long-running crew. Johnny Cat and Mike Phillips serve as regular hosts bringing their expertise and welcoming spirit to each session. This is one of the most established blues jams in the area having been a fixture in the South Bay music scene for years attracting skilled musicians and creating memorable musical moments week after week.Music SceneThe jam welcomes blues musicians who are ready to play at a professional level. With full backline provided players can show up with their instruments and join in the rotation. The session has a loyal following of both performers and listeners who appreciate authentic blues played with skill and passion in a supportive environment.","37.377233841475|-122.02950842408||37.377233841475, -122.02950842408","Dennis Dove Johnny Cat Mike Phillips",,"In Person",,739|node|b9a071fa-9091-43c2-b85b-b210e191edb1|/fuego-sports-bar-club,"Fuego Sports Bar & Club",
