coming atmosphere where great food and authentic blues come together creating a perfect evening out.Thursday Blues JamThe Thursday blues jam from 6-9 PM is a well-established session that relocated to Little Lou's from another venue bringing its tradition and community of musicians with it. With rotating hosts and full backline provided the jam welcomes blues musicians ready to play. Note that sessions may occasionally be pre-empted by major sports broadcasts so checking the venue's calendar before heading out is recommended.Venue ExperienceThe combination of quality BBQ and live blues makes Little Lou's a great destination for both food and music lovers. The laid-back atmosphere supports both performers and audiences creating an authentic blues experience in the heart of Campbell.","37.278706930589|-121.95020927991||37.278706930589, -121.95020927991","Rotating hosts",,"In Person",,740|node|7e8fe383-4a1a-4b5a-9872-4a04d2020174|/little-lous-bbq,"Little Lou's BBQ",
