ch of San JoseFirst Unitarian Church of San Jose offers a beautiful sanctuary space with exceptional acoustics making it an ideal venue for musical and spoken word performances. The church welcomes the community for various events including their monthly open mic and game night.Open Mic and Game NightHeld on the second Saturday of each month from 6-9:30 PM this unique event combines music and entertainment in two spaces. The sanctuary hosts open mic sign-ups starting at 6 PM with a performer drawing at 6:20 PM. Musicians and spoken word artists perform in the beautiful acoustically-rich sanctuary while the social hall offers games including cards and board games - guests are welcome to bring their own games as well.Community SpiritThe event is free though donations are welcome to support use of the church space. Limited drinks are available for purchase. This welcoming community event provides a supportive environment for performers and a relaxing social atmosphere for all attendees. For more information contact Rick at (408) 930-7372.","37.339896994688|-121.889242441||37.339896994688, -121.889242441",Rick,,"In Person from 6:00 PM",,,"First Unitarian Church",
