rts throughout the week featuring rock punk alternative and various other genres. The Tuesday night open mic and karaoke has become a beloved tradition for local musicians and karaoke enthusiasts.Venue FeaturesThis standing-room venue can hold up to 400 people and features two full-service bars professional sound equipment and a stage that brings performers and audiences together. The venue regularly hosts both touring acts from around the country and local Fresno bands.","36.759009505045|-119.79933068418||36.759009505045, -119.79933068418",,,"In Person from 7:30 PM",,716|node|2f460296-ce56-43aa-87b1-c69618fbfffc|/strummers,Strummer's,
