tThe casino hosts a variety of live music events including the popular Sunday Night Blues Jam series. The venue features a full bar and restaurant serving until 3 AM and shows all major sporting and pay-per-view events on large video walls.FacilitiesWith multiple bars including a gorgeous outdoor patio for dining and events Club One Casino provides a unique atmosphere for live music. The venue is conveniently located off the 168 freeway just minutes from Fresno Yosemite International Airport.","36.789537077397|-119.7513307818||36.789537077397, -119.7513307818","Richie Blue Band",,"In Person",,717|node|c70dec20-eda0-40b2-8c0a-44847fe4b601|/club-one-casino,"Club One Casino",
