ado St Brewing Co Humble Sea Brewing Co and Moonraker.Live Music SceneThe venue hosts live music most Thursday Friday and Saturday nights starting around 8 PM. Beyond concerts Tap & Cellar has become a gathering spot for jazz musicians who meet for monthly jam sessions creating an intimate musical experience.Food & DrinkTap & Cellar features 25 rotating craft beers on tap alongside a carefully curated wine selection from local vineyards and renowned regions like Napa and Calistoga. The menu includes flatbreads pizzas charcuterie boards and rotating food specials. The venue offers both indoor seating and a charming outdoor patio.","36.846013910174|-119.79495289211||36.846013910174, -119.79495289211",,,"In Person",,718|node|8a5b71b3-3bbb-4640-9666-022a0a2f3b0c|/tap-cellar,"Tap & Cellar",
