s others who shaped American folk music.The Venue ExperienceLocated in a cozy basement space in Harvard Square Club Passim offers an intimate setting where every seat provides excellent sightlines and acoustics. The venue presents over 400 shows per year ranging from traditional folk and bluegrass to singer-songwriter performances.Music ProgrammingIn addition to its regular concert series Passim hosts the annual Down Home Up Here bluegrass and old-time festival featuring workshops and jam sessions. The venue also runs open mic nights and maintains a School of Music offering workshops and classes for aspiring musicians of all ages.","42.37461300391|-71.118879591643||42.37461300391, -71.118879591643",,,"In Person from 6:00 PM",https://www.passim.org/live-music/club-passim/openmic/,687|node|b09b52a9-3993-4b5b-a7bc-b04fafdb3369|/club-passim,"Club Passim",
