hentic character. Open from 10am-2am daily Carl's Place offers a true Des Moines dive bar experience.|basic_html|About Carl's PlaceCarl's Place is a beloved neighborhood dive bar in the Sherman Hill area of Des Moines. This authentic dive bar has been serving the community for years offering a comfortable unpretentious atmosphere with long hours and reasonable prices.Blues Tuesday & Open MicEvery Tuesday Carl's Place hosts an open mic night that has become legendary in the local music scene. The event features live blues music and welcomes musicians to perform in a professionally-run environment. The venue is known for having one of the best house blues bands in the city.Dive Bar CharacterCarl's Place embodies classic dive bar charm with its pool table dart boards and small stage for live music. The extensive beer selection is listed on Untappd and the bartenders are known for their quick friendly service. The atmosphere is relaxed and welcoming making it a favorite among locals and travelers alike.Community HubThis Sherman Hill institution has become the neighborhood's version of Cheers where regulars and newcomers mix freely. The venue attracts a diverse eclectic crowd and maintains its authentic character. Open from 10am-2am daily Carl's Place offers a true Des Moines dive bar experience.","41.588123212074|-93.639314377698||41.588123212074, -93.639314377698",,,"In Person",,637|node|dc3fa959-e8c1-4b74-af7a-9ccfd329b6a8|/carls-place,"Carl's Place",
