ic up to 7 nights a week and serves as a cornerstone of Des Moines diverse and talented music culture. All ages shows run 5-9pm per city law while 21+ events continue later.|basic_html|About Lefty's Live MusicLefty's Live Music is a 350-capacity concert hall and full-service bar in the Drake Neighborhood of Des Moines. Since opening in 2015 it has become the premier destination for live music in central Iowa welcoming all genres from rock and hip hop to bluegrass metal folk and blues.Manic Monday Open MicEvery Monday at 8pm Lefty's hosts an open mic night that encourages all types of performers. Whether you want to jam show off stand-up comedy or just take the stage the venue provides a full PA system and backline equipment. The supportive atmosphere makes it perfect for first-timers and veterans alike.Venue FeaturesThe venue features quality sound systems proper stage lighting and a full bar. With a capacity of 350 it strikes the perfect balance between intimate and energetic. Lefty's has hosted everything from national touring acts to local garage bands and maintains a strong commitment to uplifting the Des Moines music scene.Music Scene HubSince 2015 Lefty's has been inspiring audiences and supporting musicians. The venue hosts live music up to 7 nights a week and serves as a cornerstone of Des Moines diverse and talented music culture. All ages shows run 5-9pm per city law while 21+ events continue later.","41.600736846291|-93.648301581402||41.600736846291, -93.648301581402",,,"In Person from 8:00 PM",,635|node|73af2f12-277a-4108-a90d-e44ef4f9b03a|/leftys-live-music,"Lefty's Live Music",
