rms into a nationally recognized music venue by night - hosting live original music 7 nights a week.Music EventsThe venue regularly showcases local - regional - and national artists across genres including alt/americana/bluegrass/red dirt/country/punk/funk/rock. The legendary Bluegrass Brunch on Sundays has become a must-experience event in the Tulsa music scene. Ticketed shows run most nights - with house resident artists playing late shows on weekdays at no cover charge.Venue AmenitiesFeatures include an open patio - covered patio with fireplace - pool table - and vintage jukebox. The venue has capacity for 150 people and is LGBTQIA affirming. Known for excellent sound quality and authentic dive bar atmosphere with eclectic decor.","36.136513167858|-95.984268749312||36.136513167858, -95.984268749312","Johnny Mullenax Band",,"In Person",,654|node|df3458b4-a179-4514-91ac-57ec4362ad23|/mercury-lounge,"Mercury Lounge",
