ands get 15 minutes with the option to sign up again non-consecutively. The venue is 18+ and provides a welcoming stage for newly formed bands professionals working on new material musicians looking to jam touring bands and anyone wanting to be part of Savannah's music scene.|basic_html|About The Wormhole Music Club and BarThe Wormhole Music Venue and Neighborhood Pub is located in the Starland Design District of Savannah. This unique venue has been serving the community for over 10 years combining a neighborhood watering hole atmosphere with a first-rate concert venue.Venue FeaturesThe venue offers billiards darts arcades pinball and classic video games including NES Sega and Nintendo 64 all available to play for free. The full kitchen stays open until 2:45 AM serving hot pressed paninis grilled wraps half-pound burgers and more made with real fresh ingredients.Music and EventsThe Wormhole hosts a diverse array of musical performances from metal to bluegrass electronica to square dancing. The venue has welcomed headlining acts like Dick Dale HELMET Band of Horses Jonathan Richman and Papadosio. They also host stand-up comedy featuring performers including Dave Chappelle David Spade and Doug Stanhope.Open Mic DetailsThe Monday night open mic runs from 8PM to 2:30AM and has been voted Best Open Mic by Connect Savannah. Solo acts get 10-15 minute sets while bands get 15 minutes with the option to sign up again non-consecutively. The venue is 18+ and provides a welcoming stage for newly formed bands professionals working on new material musicians looking to jam touring bands and anyone wanting to be part of Savannah's music scene.","32.055550098898|-81.102675175676||32.055550098898, -81.102675175676",,,"In Person from 8:00 PM",,641|node|cf7bd13c-c500-4862-9c38-bd96bf85075b|/wormhole,"The Wormhole",
648,d0e99439-5ff1-44ff-b38f-a5f27b509d13,668,en,events|node_type|76710fc4-3157-498e-ba85-0501ed7ed1ac,"2026-02-22T23:06:03+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP",0|user|be5374ea-047e-466c-bcb7-99c31dfe5df9|/user/0,,1,0|user|be5374ea-047e-466c-bcb7-99c31dfe5df9|/user/0,"Open Mic @ 208 Wine Bar","2026-02-22T23:06:03+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP","2026-02-22T23:51:52+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP",,,1,1,"meta|title|Open Mic @ 208 Wine Bar | Open Jam Events|meta|robots|index, follow|link|canonical|https://openjamevents.com/open-mic-208-wine-bar",/open-mic-208-wine-bar|474|en,,,Thursdays,"Popular Thursday night open mic hosted by Savannah artist Brandi Olenyik featuring a rotating lineup of local musicians. Each week brings intimate solo sets and surprising collaborations in a cozy wine bar setting.",,"208 E Bay St Savannah GA 31401","6:30 PM - 8:30 PM","About 208 Wine Bar208 Wine Bar is nestled above River Street in a historic building dating to 1859 built by John Stoddard for his thriving cotton trade. The venue brings cozy elegance and creative energy to downtown Savannah with over 50 wines by the glass flight or bottle.Atmosphere and SettingLocated on Upper Factors Walk just behind River Street this intimate wine bar offers an upscale yet cozy escape. Large windows provide picturesque views of ships arriving and departing on the Savannah River creating a serene atmosphere perfect for conversation and relaxation.Music ProgrammingThe venue hosts open mic nights every Thursday from 6:30-8:30 PM and live music performances every other Saturday. The intimate setting seats up to 45 adults creating a warm personal atmosphere where every performance feels special. Known for its welcoming vibe where locals gather stories are shared and the creative energy is always charged.Wine SelectionThe carefully curated wine list features eclectic selections from around the globe including unique wine flights like Tour de France and selections from India. The knowledgeable staff led by owner Christina provides expert guidance in wine selection. The venue recently expanded to include cocktails becoming 208 Wine Bar and Cocktail Lounge.|basic_html|About 208 Wine Bar208 Wine Bar is nestled above River Street in a historic building dating to 1859 built by John Stoddard for his thriving cotton trade. The venue brings cozy elegance and creative energy to downtown Savannah with over 50 wines by the glass flight or bottle.Atmosphere and SettingLocated on Upper Factors Walk just behind River Street this intimate wine bar offers an upscale yet cozy escape. Large windows provide picturesque views of ships arriving and departing on the Savannah River creating a serene atmosphere perfect for conversation and relaxation.Music ProgrammingThe venue hosts open mic nights every Thursday from 6:30-8:30 PM and live music performances every other Saturday. The intimate setting seats up to 45 adults creating a warm personal atmosphere where every performance feels special. Known for its welcoming vibe where locals gather stories are shared and the creative energy is always charged.Wine SelectionThe carefully curated wine list features eclectic selections from around the globe including unique wine flights like Tour de France and selections from India. The knowledgeable staff led by owner Christina provides expert guidance in wine selection. The venue recently expanded to include cocktails becoming 208 Wine Bar and Cocktail Lounge.","32.080905684786|-81.087879653314||32.080905684786, -81.087879653314","Brandi Olenyik",,"In Person from 6:30 PM",,642|node|7c9f9905-9f7e-4f5c-871d-ca9bbf844897|/208-wine-bar,"208 Wine Bar",
