 downtown it's an ideal spot for groups looking for good music and dancing.|basic_html|About El Rocko LoungeEl Rocko Lounge is a retro-themed cocktail lounge located on Whitaker Street in downtown Savannah near City Market and River Street. Established in 2016 this venue has become known as Savannah's destination for live entertainment.Venue AtmosphereThe lounge features classy retro decor with a capacity of 150 people. Known for its frozen cocktails and wide draft beer selection the venue offers happy hour specials and maintains a vibrant late-night atmosphere. The space is designed for dancing and socializing with good acoustics for live performances.Music and EntertainmentEl Rocko hosts weekly rock hip hop and DJ sets along with comedy performances. Thursday through Saturday the venue features live music from 9 PM to 1 AM. The Tuesday open mic night welcomes all musicians to bring their instruments and participate with no cover charge. The venue is 21+ and open from 5 PM to 3 AM Monday through Saturday.Bar FeaturesThe bartenders are known for their skill and charm creating excellent cocktails and maintaining an energetic friendly vibe. The venue provides bike parking street parking and accepts credit cards. Located conveniently in the heart of downtown it's an ideal spot for groups looking for good music and dancing.","32.078904416525|-81.092760905429||32.078904416525, -81.092760905429",,,"In Person from 8:00 PM",,644|node|7d324ebc-2548-43a1-9392-4f400791fdaa|/el-rocko-lounge,"El Rocko Lounge",
