e week.Events & EntertainmentBeyond the Monday open mic nights, Front Street Taproom hosts trivia nights, vinyl listening parties, and live music on weekends. The venue features The Cellar, an underground comedy club located below the taproom that hosts professional touring comedians and special events.Atmosphere & AmenitiesThe rustic wooden decor and comfortable seating create a warm, welcoming environment perfect for creative expression. While food is not served, guests can order delivery from neighboring Rhombus Guys pizza. The venue features a spacious mezzanine available for private events and gatherings.","46.874441924352|-96.788393423243||46.874441924352, -96.788393423243","Travis Neros",,"In Person from 7:30 PM",,626|node|88ae5f30-40ef-4bae-880d-40a4de886954|/front-street-taproom,"Front Street Taproom",
