enticity with modern amenities for live performances.|basic_html|About Troll LoungeLocated inside the Sons of Norway Kringen Lodge, the Troll Lounge is one of Fargo's most unique music venues. The bar features hand-carved wooden trolls and Norwegian murals creating an unforgettable atmosphere that sets it apart from typical performance spaces.Music EventsThe Troll Lounge hosts weekly live music events featuring local and regional musicians playing rock, folk, country, and traditional Norwegian music. The monthly Amped Open Mic provides a low-pressure performance opportunity for emerging artists with professional backline equipment available on stage.Cultural ExperienceAs part of the Sons of Norway cultural organization, the venue celebrates Norwegian heritage while welcoming the broader community. The Kringen Kafé serves traditional Scandinavian-American cuisine Tuesday through Friday. Happy hour runs from 4:30 PM to 6:00 PM with drink specials.Venue DetailsThis is a 21+ venue with special accommodation for performers under 21. Individuals under 18 must be accompanied by a parent, and adults 18-20 are only permitted when performing. The space combines cultural authenticity with modern amenities for live performances.","46.878389379056|-96.791317312162||46.878389379056, -96.791317312162","Amped School of Music",,"In Person",,627|node|1e7cec7e-f066-4c45-8395-27e6b6957b95|/troll-lounge-sons-norway,"Troll Lounge",
