ellent acoustics for traditional bluegrass music.|basic_html|About Troll LoungeLocated inside the Sons of Norway Kringen Lodge, the Troll Lounge is one of Fargo's most unique music venues. The bar features hand-carved wooden trolls and Norwegian murals creating an unforgettable atmosphere that sets it apart from typical performance spaces.Music EventsThe Troll Lounge hosts weekly live music events featuring local and regional musicians playing rock, folk, country, and traditional Norwegian music. The Tuesday bluegrass jam brings together the community's acoustic musicians for collaborative picking sessions in a relaxed, supportive environment.Cultural ExperienceAs part of the Sons of Norway cultural organization, the venue celebrates Norwegian heritage while welcoming the broader community. The Kringen Kafé serves traditional Scandinavian-American cuisine Tuesday through Friday. Happy hour runs from 4:30 PM to 6:00 PM with drink specials.Venue DetailsThis is a 21+ venue with admission always free for jam sessions. The lounge opens at 4:30 PM with drink specials until 6:00 PM, making it easy to arrive early and settle in before the music begins. The intimate setting provides excellent acoustics for traditional bluegrass music.","46.878389379056|-96.791317312162||46.878389379056, -96.791317312162",,,"In Person",,627|node|1e7cec7e-f066-4c45-8395-27e6b6957b95|/troll-lounge-sons-norway,,
