er's Bistro DaDa brings creative twists to both dining and drinking experiences.|basic_html|About DaDa GastropubA creative full-service restaurant and cocktail bar located within ICON Events in historic downtown Sioux Falls. The building was once a John Deere factory and now features eclectic artwork and decor that celebrates the Dadaist art movement.Music and EntertainmentTuesday nights feature live music from house band The Heinous 3 from 8-10 PM with free admission and full dinner service until 10 PM. The venue regularly welcomes live music into the space and occasionally closes the dining room early to accommodate touring acts. DaDa is located near Falls Park and the Levitt Bandshell.Dining ExperienceThe gastropub specializes in unique cuisine options sourcing sustainable and local products. The menu is ever-changing to accommodate seasonal availability. A beautiful covered patio features functional original garage doors that open into the dining room creating an intimate indoor-outdoor atmosphere.Hours and AtmosphereOpen Tuesday through Saturday starting at 5 PM. The venue offers expertly-crafted cocktails from a full bar alongside thoughtful cuisine. Sister business to Sioux Falls' beloved Parker's Bistro DaDa brings creative twists to both dining and drinking experiences.","43.55201279319|-96.726263220619||43.55201279319, -96.726263220619","The Heinous 3",,"No sign-up - scheduled performance",,601|node|22af11cd-005d-489a-8a11-aa331d6c463a|/dada-gastropub,"DaDa Gastropub",
