 Circle believes in helping and strengthening the creative and progressive community in Sioux Falls. The venue features work from local artists in vendor booths and donates books to local shelters and prisons. Regular events and affordable prices ensure the space remains accessible to all.|basic_html|About Full Circle Book Co-opAn inclusive independent bookstore beer and wine bar and event space in downtown Sioux Falls. This cultural hub merges the pleasures of reading with a welcoming community atmosphere providing a safe space for people of all ages to hang out discuss create and enjoy.Events and CommunitySunday nights feature open mic events welcoming musicians poets and performers of all kinds. The venue regularly hosts live podcasts poetry readings book clubs and various community gatherings. Non-profit poetry open mics help raise funds for local organizations. The space is notably LGBTQ-friendly and promotes progressive ideals through education creative writing poetry and the arts.Books and AtmosphereThe co-op boasts a vast collection of new and used books including rare finds and signed editions. Featured works include extensive selections from local and regional authors. The warm friendly staff and cozy environment make it a popular gathering spot. A bar serves beer wine coffee tea and non-alcoholic beverages allowing guests to enjoy drinks while browsing or attending events.MissionFull Circle believes in helping and strengthening the creative and progressive community in Sioux Falls. The venue features work from local artists in vendor booths and donates books to local shelters and prisons. Regular events and affordable prices ensure the space remains accessible to all.","43.54606374296|-96.726815537571||43.54606374296, -96.726815537571",,,"In Person",,602|node|20aaba32-0a64-4128-9a0c-1bda0a73030b|/full-circle-book-co-op,"Full Circle Book Co-op",
