proom and outdoor seating area.Live MusicHopworks regularly hosts live music events including the Thursday night vintage bluegrass jam session. The brewery provides a casual welcoming atmosphere perfect for musicians and fans to enjoy traditional bluegrass music while sampling their award-winning organic beers.Food and DrinkThe brewery offers a full menu of food including pizza burgers and vegetarian options all made with locally sourced ingredients when possible. Their extensive beer list features flagship brews seasonal offerings and limited releases.","45.516451654414|-122.5910087509||45.516451654414, -122.5910087509",Patrick,,"In Person",,586|node|13e0f83d-61f6-4265-bacb-a670fd1f91e7|/hopworks-powell-mothership,"Hopworks Brewery - Powell Mothership",
