 since 1941. The hotel combines classic Western elegance with modern amenities and sits just steps from Town Square.The Silver Dollar Bar & ShowroomThe famous Silver Dollar Bar features 2032 uncirculated 1921 Morgan Silver Dollars inlaid in its serpentine bar top. The adjacent Silver Dollar Showroom serves as Jackson's premier downtown music venue hosting local regional and national acts throughout the year.Musical TraditionBluegrass Tuesdays with One Ton Pig has become a beloved Jackson Hole institution. Named Best Band in the 2025 Best of Jackson Hole contest One Ton Pig draws packed crowds of dancers and music lovers every Tuesday year-round. The venue also hosts live music Thursday Friday and Saturday evenings featuring various genres from country to folk and rock. During winter months the Hootenanny open mic relocates here from Dornan's creating another weekly musical tradition.","43.480186874772|-110.76191767829||43.480186874772, -110.76191767829","One Ton Pig",,,,568|node|a730ecdc-2e31-4b0b-bcff-4741b50b3b3f|/wort-hotel-silver-dollar-bar,"Wort Hotel",
575,245f1c7f-9cec-407a-9256-c47ec4414abf,595,en,events|node_type|76710fc4-3157-498e-ba85-0501ed7ed1ac,"2026-02-22T16:34:08+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP",0|user|be5374ea-047e-466c-bcb7-99c31dfe5df9|/user/0,,1,0|user|be5374ea-047e-466c-bcb7-99c31dfe5df9|/user/0,"Open Mic Night @ The Virginian Saloon","2026-02-22T16:34:08+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP","2026-02-22T16:38:47+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP",,,1,1,"meta|title|Open Mic Night @ The Virginian Saloon | Open Jam Events|meta|robots|index, follow|link|canonical|https://openjamevents.com/open-mic-night-virginian-saloon",/open-mic-night-virginian-saloon|406|en,"PA system and basic backline",,Tuesdays,"Community-focused open mic and jam session that welcomes musicians poets comedians and performers of all abilities. The night begins with open mic performances and evolves into a collaborative jam session.",,"750 W Broadway St Jackson WY 83001","7:00 PM - 12:00 AM","About The Virginian SaloonThe Virginian Saloon is part of the historic Virginian Lodge which has been a Jackson Hole institution since 1965. This rustic-chic establishment blends authentic Western charm with modern amenities creating an inviting atmosphere for locals and visitors alike.Entertainment & AtmosphereThe Virginian Saloon offers diverse entertainment throughout the week including open mic nights live music from regional and national bands karaoke sessions and sports viewing on multiple flatscreen TVs. The venue features reclaimed wood stone accents and vintage Western decor creating an authentic cowboy atmosphere.Community EventsBeyond Tuesday open mics the Virginian hosts Industry Nights on Mondays featuring bingo trivia and rotating themes with late-night happy hour. The saloon has become a hub for the local music community offering a supportive environment for emerging artists and established performers to share their talents with an enthusiastic audience.|basic_html|About The Virginian SaloonThe Virginian Saloon is part of the historic Virginian Lodge which has been a Jackson Hole institution since 1965. This rustic-chic establishment blends authentic Western charm with modern amenities creating an inviting atmosphere for locals and visitors alike.Entertainment & AtmosphereThe Virginian Saloon offers diverse entertainment throughout the week including open mic nights live music from regional and national bands karaoke sessions and sports viewing on multiple flatscreen TVs. The venue features reclaimed wood stone accents and vintage Western decor creating an authentic cowboy atmosphere.Community EventsBeyond Tuesday open mics the Virginian hosts Industry Nights on Mondays featuring bingo trivia and rotating themes with late-night happy hour. The saloon has become a hub for the local music community offering a supportive environment for emerging artists and established performers to share their talents with an enthusiastic audience.","43.474193843218|-110.77821429287||43.474193843218, -110.77821429287",,,"In Person",,569|node|5c861659-1e8e-474f-9562-9f53537c1a9b|/virginian-saloon,"The Virginian Saloon",
