son Hole's favorite pizza spot winning the local vote annually. Located in the Pink Garter Plaza just off Town Square the restaurant specializes in hand-tossed New York-style pizza.Featured on Food NetworkPinky G's has been featured twice on Food Network's Diners Drive-Ins and Dives showcasing their unique pies like the famous Abe Froman. USA Today called it one of the most reasonably priced restaurants in Wyoming's highest rent town making it a popular spot for both locals and visitors.Music & CommunityThe pizzeria features a small stage and hosts live music performances from local Jackson Hole musicians in addition to the Monday open mic nights. The all-ages family-friendly atmosphere combined with affordable prices and late-night hours (until midnight on weekends) makes Pinky G's a community gathering place. Performers at the open mic receive a free tallboy or slice of pizza encouraging participation from musicians of all skill levels.","43.479634757952|-110.76186274337||43.479634757952, -110.76186274337",,,"In Person",,570|node|26bd10ff-1da9-4bd2-9508-074631c69c8d|/pinky-gs-pizzeria,"Pinky G's Pizzeria",
577,b1961776-815d-4c2e-8682-d15a628cb5c7,597,en,events|node_type|76710fc4-3157-498e-ba85-0501ed7ed1ac,"2026-02-22T16:34:08+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP",0|user|be5374ea-047e-466c-bcb7-99c31dfe5df9|/user/0,,1,0|user|be5374ea-047e-466c-bcb7-99c31dfe5df9|/user/0,"Sunday Church @ Stagecoach Bar","2026-02-22T16:34:08+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP","2026-02-22T16:42:35+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP",,,1,1,"meta|title|Sunday Church @ Stagecoach Bar | Open Jam Events|meta|robots|index, follow|link|canonical|https://openjamevents.com/sunday-church-stagecoach-bar",/sunday-church-stagecoach-bar|408|en,"Full band setup",,Sundays,"Legendary weekly dance and music night featuring the world-famous Stagecoach Band which has played every Sunday for over 40 years. Known locally as Church this is a Jackson Hole institution with country music and Western swing dancing.",,"5755 W Highway 22 Wilson WY 83014","6:00 PM - 10:00 PM","About Stagecoach BarThe Stagecoach Bar has been a Jackson Hole favorite since 1942 making it one of the area's oldest establishments. Located in Wilson Wyoming at the base of Teton Pass the venue is affectionately known as The Coach by locals.Sunday Church TraditionThe Stagecoach Band has performed more than 2500 Sunday nights over the past 44 years creating one of Wyoming's most enduring musical traditions. Going to church on Sunday evening is local slang for heading to the Stagecoach to dance to live country and Western swing music. The band's performances draw crowds from across the valley filling the large dance floor with couples and solo dancers alike.Other EntertainmentThursdays feature Disco Night with a DJ spinning classic hits from the 70s and 80s. The venue offers a full bar with eight beers on tap pool tables darts and during summer a deck with beach volleyball. Friday and Saturday nights often feature one-off shows with touring and regional acts. The Stagecoach Grill serves affordable Mexican food and burgers and the venue includes a full-service liquor store with a drive-up window.|basic_html|About Stagecoach BarThe Stagecoach Bar has been a Jackson Hole favorite since 1942 making it one of the area's oldest establishments. Located in Wilson Wyoming at the base of Teton Pass the venue is affectionately known as The Coach by locals.Sunday Church TraditionThe Stagecoach Band has performed more than 2500 Sunday nights over the past 44 years creating one of Wyoming's most enduring musical traditions. Going to church on Sunday evening is local slang for heading to the Stagecoach to dance to live country and Western swing music. The band's performances draw crowds from across the valley filling the large dance floor with couples and solo dancers alike.Other EntertainmentThursdays feature Disco Night with a DJ spinning classic hits from the 70s and 80s. The venue offers a full bar with eight beers on tap pool tables darts and during summer a deck with beach volleyball. Friday and Saturday nights often feature one-off shows with touring and regional acts. The Stagecoach Grill serves affordable Mexican food and burgers and the venue includes a full-service liquor store with a drive-up window.","43.49841644535|-110.87623221244||43.49841644535, -110.87623221244","The Stagecoach Band",,,,571|node|906b710c-1c1c-4951-acc1-c18a903349af|/stagecoach-bar,"Stagecoach Bar",
