test incarnation of the oldest and most notorious bar in the Cottonwood Heights area.Live MusicThe venue features live music Wednesday through Sunday with Monday night dedicated to open jam sessions. Musical styles include rock jazz blues reggae bluegrass and Americana. The pub has received numerous awards including City Weekly's Best Neighborhood Bar and Best Escape From Downtown.Venue CharacterHoused in a cozy log cabin with an intricate wood carving behind the bar Hog Wallow offers an extensive spirits beer and wine list along with elevated pub food. The venue features a popular outdoor patio and has become a favorite après-ski destination and mountain community gathering place.","40.624954061957|-111.79966074391||40.624954061957, -111.79966074391","House band",,"In Person",,532|node|113493f4-ffc6-495a-ad39-4543da9cd1b7|/hog-wallow-pub,"Hog Wallow Pub",
