 interested in experiencing authentic jazz in a neighborhood setting. The combination of quality music affordable pricing and a genuine love for jazz culture has made Centro a beloved institution in Milwaukee's music scene.|basic_html|About Centro CafeCentro Cafe (also known as Bar Centro) is a cornerstone of Milwaukee's Riverwest neighborhood jazz scene located on East Center Street. This intimate venue has established itself as one of the premier spots for live jazz in Milwaukee offering performances three to four nights a week. The cafe features a welcoming atmosphere that attracts both seasoned jazz aficionados and newcomers to the genre.Jazz ProgrammingCentro hosts a monthly jazz jam session every first Thursday with no cover charge and drink specials making it accessible to all music lovers. The venue regularly features performances by notable Milwaukee jazz musicians and serves as a home for Milwaukee Jazz Institute presentations. Friday and Saturday nights showcase professional jazz acts creating an electrifying soul and jazz atmosphere. The venue has hosted performances by acclaimed artists like B.D. Greer & The Gents and numerous other local and regional jazz talents.Venue ExperienceWith reservations available and walk-ins welcome Centro Cafe maintains a balance between intimate club atmosphere and accessibility. The venue's commitment to supporting the Milwaukee jazz community makes it an essential stop for anyone interested in experiencing authentic jazz in a neighborhood setting. The combination of quality music affordable pricing and a genuine love for jazz culture has made Centro a beloved institution in Milwaukee's music scene.","43.067709798691|-87.900852769633||43.067709798691, -87.900852769633",,,"In Person",,514|node|5db05dc6-5879-47b9-a4ee-84b5bd6f3a02|/centro-cafe,"Centro Cafe",
