e music of all genres sound and lighting that rival larger venues and a welcoming atmosphere perfect for bachelorette parties birthdays and nights out with friends.","43.053201917705|-87.895881990737||43.053201917705, -87.895881990737","Uncle Don",,"In Person",,513|node|2acf7fab-7e42-43ab-a587-2b66b2d43dc7|/nashville-north,"Nashville North",
