am SessionsFree Sunday afternoon sessions from 1 PM hosted by Kansas City sensation Levee Town. Saturday sessions run 12:30-6 PM. All skill levels welcome. 21+ venue but minors allowed with parent or guardian.Regular ProgrammingLive music Wednesday through Monday with shows typically starting at 7:30-8 PM. The venue features blues rock country Americana and diverse genres. Knuckleheads has become known as a place where the worlds greatest musicians play.AmenitiesFull bar service with reasonably priced drinks and food options. The venue features both indoor and outdoor spaces with excellent sound systems and stage equipment for performers.","39.120714768084|-94.548307183467||39.120714768084, -94.548307183467","Levee Town",,"In Person from 1:00 PM",,484|node|87efa9bf-db04-4a94-91c4-dd1a0ad3352e|/knuckleheads,Knuckleheads,
