hoods north of the river.Open Mic ProgrammingFree Monday Song Lab music open mic from 7-10 PM. All skill levels and genres welcome. The venue is passionate about supporting local music and touring artists with 100% of cover charges going to performers.Venue Space200-person capacity venue with excellent acoustics stage and A/V equipment. The Rino operates as a free co-working space during the day opening at 7 AM. Full bar service available during events.Location and AccessibilityLocated in the vibrant River North district just a short bridge from City Market. The neighborhood is growing rapidly with new restaurants cafes and cultural spaces. Free co-working space available alongside Cultivar coffee next door.","39.142451829825|-94.576228727645||39.142451829825, -94.576228727645",,,"In Person from 7:00 PM",,486|node|5b1ea22b-41c6-43e3-9496-78a385b4159d|/rino,"The Rino",
