own Saint Paul landmark. This upscale cocktail bar and cabaret features a large u-shaped bar - cozy sidewalk patio - pool table - and performance stage with piano. The venue is known for generous drinks and 16 craft beers on tap.The Cabaret at CampThe Cabaret @ Camp is one of St. Paul's premier performing arts spaces - managed by Actors Theater of Minnesota. The intimate venue features state-of-the-art sound and lighting - dynamic seating - a unique stage with green room - and full-service bar. The space hosts professional theatrical productions - musical acts - dance parties - and nationally known stand-up comedians every weekend.Weekly Events and EntertainmentThe venue hosts Variety Open Mic on Monday nights (except the first Monday) - comedy open mic on Sundays - Music Mayhem Trivia on Wednesdays - and Trivia Mafia on Thursdays. Camp Bar is an Official Green Bay Packers Bar. The LGBTQIA+ friendly venue creates an inclusive environment for the community.","44.950978840968|-93.093123137293||44.950978840968, -93.093123137293","Robert Cudinski",,"In Person from 7:45 PM",,474|node|fb4b1607-2cc6-4eee-90e9-69b5267f4778|/camp-bar,"Camp Bar",
