aintains an all-ages policy until 10 PM - making it accessible to younger performers and families. Open mic nights welcome musicians - comedians - and poets in a supportive environment where performers can build confidence before moving to larger stages. The combination of great food - quality drinks - and genuine community spirit makes Kupros a Midtown favorite.|basic_html|Kupros Craft HouseMidtown's Premier Craft Bar in a Historic SettingSituated in a beautifully preserved 1910 two-story Craftsman building - Kupros Craft House embodies the charm and character of Midtown Sacramento. The venue's Victorian decor - polished wood accents - and stained glass fixtures create a warm - inviting atmosphere that feels like a second home to regulars. The unique architecture includes the only upstairs balcony in Midtown - plus a spacious front porch perfect for Sacramento's mild evenings.Craft Beverages and Elevated CuisineKupros features an extensive selection of craft beers and hand-crafted cocktails alongside a menu of elevated bar classics made with fresh local ingredients. Popular dishes include buffalo cauliflower bites - chicken sandwiches - and their famous Cobb salad. Weekend brunch draws crowds for generous mimosa pitchers and fluffy French toast. The kitchen focuses on quality ingredients and creative preparations that exceed typical bar food expectations.Community Events and EntertainmentBeyond Tuesday open mics - Kupros hosts trivia nights and live music throughout the week. The venue maintains an all-ages policy until 10 PM - making it accessible to younger performers and families. Open mic nights welcome musicians - comedians - and poets in a supportive environment where performers can build confidence before moving to larger stages. The combination of great food - quality drinks - and genuine community spirit makes Kupros a Midtown favorite.","38.573711390357|-121.47865058403||38.573711390357, -121.47865058403",,,"In Person from 7:30 PM",,440|node|b6bf4cb8-ccd3