ecording & Sound building on the Boise Bench.Mission & ServicesThe Hive's mission is to prevent suicide in the music community by offering counseling - education - referrals - and mental health services for musicians. The venue maintains an alcohol and drug-free all-ages environment.Music ProgramsBoise Hive hosts Open Mic Nights - Live at the Hive Saturday concerts - Jazz Jam sessions - and various music education programs. The venue features four studios/rehearsal spaces - a community room - multimedia room - recording studio - and more. Regular programs include Student Jazz - Audio Recording Classes - Veterans Sessions - and Hip Hop at The Hive.","43.590480615549|-116.2294909217||43.590480615549, -116.2294909217",,,"In Person from 6:30 PM",,428|node|426e89fd-69f8-4024-b12a-4e5f916ef953|/boise-hive,"Boise Hive",
