al growth.Jazz at The HiveGHJF Jam Nights are presented by Boise State University with the Boise Jazz Society as Signature Sponsor. The sessions feature a tune of the month and provide a platform for jazz musicians to connect improvise and grow their skills in an encouraging environment.Community ImpactThese jams honor Gene Harris's approach to teaching jazz - patiently accompanying students as they experience the living American art form. Each performance is unique with no two nights ever the same creating an authentic jazz experience for both performers and audiences.","43.590535010775|-116.22956602355||43.590535010775, -116.22956602355","Boise State University Gene Harris Music Program",,"In Person",,428|node|426e89fd-69f8-4024-b12a-4e5f916ef953|/boise-hive,"Boise Hive",
