cs and a recognizable 10-story stage house visible from across Boise.FacilitiesMorrison Center includes the Main Hall (2002 capacity) - Danny Peterson Theatre (210 capacity) - and Recital Hall (200 capacity). The venue offers accessible seating - assistive listening devices - parking in the Brady Garage - and premium amenities for patrons.ProgrammingThe center hosts Broadway touring productions - symphony performances - dance companies - and jazz events including the Gene Harris Jazz Jam series. The venue serves as a cultural cornerstone for Boise generating significant economic impact while bringing world-class performances to Idaho.","43.606986880968|-116.20601620873||43.606986880968, -116.20601620873","Boise State University Gene Harris Music Program",,"In Person",,429|node|2b89372a-3b96-45f1-88aa-418711e3eb84|/morrison-center,"Morrison Center",
