ed beers bourbon barrel finishing and craft spirits honoring Kentucky's distilling legacy.Taproom & FoodThe taproom features 12 Goodwood-brewed beers on tap plus wine and local spirits. The kitchen serves southern-inspired cuisine including Chicken and Waffles Fried Green Tomatoes and brisket-topped burgers. Music Bingo happens Tuesdays with Trivia on Thursdays.Bluegrass JamEvery Saturday afternoon the taproom hosts an open bluegrass jam from 3-6 PM. The session has been running for years bringing together fiddle banjo guitar mandolin and bass players for traditional bluegrass picking. No cover charge just bring your instrument and join the circle or sit back with a craft beer and listen.","38.255183628735|-85.738334655695||38.255183628735, -85.738334655695","502 Stringband",,"In Person",,339|node|2133de1b-fef9-46f3-95b3-b21af46cfb97|/goodwood-brewing,"Goodwood Brewing",
