113,8c0d401d-853a-4fcc-ab5c-ccbe711a45a0,125,en,events|node_type|76710fc4-3157-498e-ba85-0501ed7ed1ac,"2026-01-20T22:59:42+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP",1|user|85298f8d-c10c-44ac-af32-f23600324c58|/user/1,,1,1|user|85298f8d-c10c-44ac-af32-f23600324c58|/user/1,"Open Mic @ MilkBoy South Street","2026-01-20T22:55:26+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP","2026-02-17T21:55:30+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP",,,1,1,"meta|title|Open Mic @ MilkBoy South Street | Open Jam Events|meta|robots|index, follow|link|canonical|https://openjamevents.com/milkboy-south-street-philly",/milkboy-south-street-philly|83|en,"Full Backline",,Tuesdays,"Chill open mic upstairs at MilkBoy South Street in Philly. Come play your songs and mingle in a chill space.",,"401 South St, Philadelphia, PA 19147","7:00 PM - 9:00 PM","Tuesday Open Mic at MilkBoy South StreetHost Katie Feeney has created something special at MilkBoy South Street's Tuesday open mic—a nurturing space where artists can be weird, experiment, and connect regardless of their experience level. The energy is infectious, the crowd supportive, and the vibe perfectly captures South Street's eclectic spirit.Sign-ups begin at 7 PM, with performances running from 8 PM to midnight. The venue's upstairs space features a small stage that puts performers close to the audience, creating intimate connection. Feeney, also known for her outlaw Americana band Roberta Faceplant, brings warmth and encouragement to every show.What makes this open mic unique is Feeney's ""audience pledge""—at the beginning of each night, everyone present promises aloud to give every performer their attention and applause. This simple ritual transforms the room into a safe space where first-timers can share songs written yesterday and experienced artists can try new instruments.The crowd is diverse and engaged—South Street brings everyone from University of the Arts students to neighborhood regulars, tourists to dedicated music fans. All genres are welcome, from acoustic folk to electric rock, spoken word to experimental noise. The backline is provided, making it accessible for musicians who don't want to haul equipment.Performances vary wildly—one night might feature a punk band followed by a jazz vocalist, a bedroom producer playing beats through a laptop, and a classical guitarist. The unpredictability is part of the charm. Between sets, performers mingle at the bar, forming bands and friendships that extend beyond Tuesday nights.|basic_html|Tuesday Open Mic at MilkBoy South StreetHost Katie Feeney has created something special at MilkBoy South Street's Tuesday open mic—a nurturing space where artists can be weird, experiment, and connect regardless of their experience level. The energy is infectious, the crowd supportive, and the vibe perfectly captures South Street's eclectic spirit.Sign-ups begin at 7 PM, with performances running from 8 PM to midnight. The venue's upstairs space features a small stage that puts performers close to the audience, creating intimate connection. Feeney, also known for her outlaw Americana band Roberta Faceplant, brings warmth and encouragement to every show.What makes this open mic unique is Feeney's ""audience pledge""—at the beginning of each night, everyone present promises aloud to give every performer their attention and applause. This simple ritual transforms the room into a safe space where first-timers can share songs written yesterday and experienced artists can try new instruments.The crowd is diverse and engaged—South Street brings everyone from University of the Arts students to neighborhood regulars, tourists to dedicated music fans. All genres are welcome, from acoustic folk to electric rock, spoken word to experimental noise. The backline is provided, making it accessible for musicians who don't want to haul equipment.Performances vary wildly—one night might feature a punk band followed by a jazz vocalist, a bedroom producer playing beats through a laptop, and a classical guitarist. The unpredictability is part of the charm. Between sets, performers mingle at the bar, forming bands and friendships that extend beyond Tuesday nights.","39.94193728271|-75.149285871164||39.94193728271, -75.149285871164","Katie Feeney",,,,114|node|faca1465-8cd3-43bc-aa59-ff817283313d|/milkboy-south-street,"MilkBoy South Street",
