ngwriter Open Mic on Wednesdays (6:30 PM), Jazz Jam Open Mic on Thursdays (8:00 PM), and Bluegrass Open Jam on Sundays (4:00 PM), making it a hub for the Triangle's music community. The venue features a professional stage with excellent sound system and accommodates 150 people, offering a wide selection of Bond Brothers craft beers, wine, cider, and non-alcoholic options. The Bulkogi food truck is on-site daily, serving Korean barbecue favorites like the Bulkogi Burger, Galbi Basket, and Kimchi Bul Fries. With both indoor seating and a large covered patio, plus plenty of parking, Bond Brothers Eastside provides an intimate, welcoming atmosphere where musicians and music lovers connect over exceptional sound quality, quality brews, and great food.","35.790882117137|-78.767818166924||35.790882117137, -78.767818166924",Thrio,,"Per Request",,56|node|5903e958-b3d5-45cc-8c50-c55595fe8cf8|/bond-brothers-eastside-cary-nc,"Bond Brothers Eastside",
