 stage for musicians and performers of all ages and skill levels, providing a high-quality PA system and staff encouragement, transforming the taproom from a simple beer hall into a genuine community forum where local talent can shine, friendships can be forged, and the true, unplugged spirit of the neighborhood is celebrated over a handcrafted beer.","35.581477137011|-78.799496164699||35.581477137011, -78.799496164699","Michael Damien Kelley",,"In person",,43|node|c6e93c4b-bf39-4fcb-869c-8b5415906428|/the-fainting-goat-brewing-company,"The Fainting Goat Brewing Company",
