27,dd6ab44c-9690-4f83-b482-ffca3c462c5e,30,en,events|node_type|76710fc4-3157-498e-ba85-0501ed7ed1ac,"2025-09-26T14:26:25+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP",1|user|85298f8d-c10c-44ac-af32-f23600324c58|/user/1,,1,1|user|85298f8d-c10c-44ac-af32-f23600324c58|/user/1,"Open Mic @ Gizmo Brew Works","2025-09-26T14:22:20+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP","2026-02-17T21:55:30+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP",,,1,1,"meta|title|Open Mic @ Gizmo Brew Works | Open Jam Events|meta|robots|index, follow|link|canonical|https://openjamevents.com/node/27",en,No,,Sundays,"Local Talent in the heart of Raleigh. Acoustic based open mic for seasoned performers and emerging artists",,"5907 Triangle Dr, Raleigh, NC 27617","3:00 PM - 6:00 PM","Gizmo Brew Works represents everything great about the craft beer movement: innovation without pretension, quality without exclusivity, and community without cliques. It's a place where experimental brewers push creative boundaries while keeping prices reasonable and the atmosphere welcoming.Whether you're stopping by for Sunday open mic, testing your knowledge at Wednesday trivia, building LEGOs with fellow adults, catching live music in the beer garden, or simply sampling your way through the tap list on a random Thursday, Gizmo delivers an experience that's authentically Raleigh.In a craft beer landscape that can sometimes take itself too seriously, Gizmo strikes the perfect balance—serious about the quality of their beer, but never forgetting that drinking it should be fun. They've built something special in that Umstead Industrial Park location: a place where innovation, entertainment, and community converge, one pour at a time.So grab some friends, bring your dog, pick up a flight board shaped like the Gizmo logo, and settle into the beer garden. Whether you're here for the beer, the music, the trivia, or just the vibe, you're in for a good time. That's the Gizmo promise, and they've been delivering on it since 2013.|basic_html|Gizmo Brew Works represents everything great about the craft beer movement: innovation without pretension, quality without exclusivity, and community without cliques. It's a place where experimental brewers push creative boundaries while keeping prices reasonable and the atmosphere welcoming.Whether you're stopping by for Sunday open mic, testing your knowledge at Wednesday trivia, building LEGOs with fellow adults, catching live music in the beer garden, or simply sampling your way through the tap list on a random Thursday, Gizmo delivers an experience that's authentically Raleigh.In a craft beer landscape that can sometimes take itself too seriously, Gizmo strikes the perfect balance—serious about the quality of their beer, but never forgetting that drinking it should be fun. They've built something special in that Umstead Industrial Park location: a place where innovation, entertainment, and community converge, one pour at a time.So grab some friends, bring your dog, pick up a flight board shaped like the Gizmo logo, and settle into the beer garden. Whether you're here for the beer, the music, the trivia, or just the vibe, you're in for a good time. That's the Gizmo promise, and they've been delivering on it since 2013.","35.897899725977|-78.728998123888||35.897899725977, -78.728998123888","Brian Jones",,"In person",,46|node|7b91bff8-e3e8-471f-8320-29f13c670c50|/gizmo-brew-works,"Gizmo Brew Works - Brewery & Taproom",
