er you're seeking a romantic evening on the rooftop deck, a fun night out with friends enjoying live music and food trucks, or a peaceful Sunday afternoon sipping wine overlooking the vineyards, ZincHouse offers an experience that lives up to its growing reputation as the Triangle's premier winery and brewery. As one visitor perfectly summarized: ""This place is so nice it feels like you left town.""For the latest events, reservations, and information, visit zinchouse.com or follow them on social media.","35.982840459755|-78.758260941157||35.982840459755, -78.758260941157","Southern Roots Entertainment",,"In person",,47|node|8caca291-2215-46f1-98d9-996266761467|/zinc-house-winery-brewery,"ZincHouse Winery & Brewery",
25,8031fc2c-a382-4ec0-b303-57c960c88aff,28,en,events|node_type|76710fc4-3157-498e-ba85-0501ed7ed1ac,"2025-09-26T14:16:45+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP",1|user|85298f8d-c10c-44ac-af32-f23600324c58|/user/1,,1,1|user|85298f8d-c10c-44ac-af32-f23600324c58|/user/1,"Open Mic @ Social Habit","2025-09-26T14:13:58+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP","2026-02-17T21:55:30+00:00|Y-m-d\TH:i:sP",,,1,1,"meta|title|Open Mic @ Social Habit | Open Jam Events|meta|robots|index, follow|link|canonical|https://openjamevents.com/node/25",en,No,,Tuesday,"Open mic with great sound system and lighting. Food trucks available across the street",,"242 N Main St, Kernersville, NC 27284","7:00 PM - 10:00 PM","Social Habit in Kernersville brings live music and performance to downtown's historic cocktail scene with open mic nights every Tuesday from 7 PM to 10 PM, featuring local musicians, singers, and performers in an intimate lounge setting. The venue regularly hosts jam sessions and live acoustic performances, creating a vibrant musical atmosphere that complements their expertly crafted cocktails. Musicians perform in a sophisticated yet welcoming 115-year-old building adorned with vintage couches, local artwork, and exposed brick walls that create perfect acoustics for intimate performances. The Tuesday open mics have become a staple for Kernersville's creative community, giving artists a platform to showcase their talents while patrons enjoy signature drinks like the Smoked Old Fashioned and Lavender Moon. Weekend live music performances typically run in the evening hours, featuring acoustic sets and small ensembles that enhance rather than overwhelm the lounge's conversation-friendly atmosphere. Founded by Mark Stamper as part of downtown Kernersville's renaissance, Social Habit has quickly established itself as a cultural hub where expertly mixed drinks and live entertainment come together to create memorable nights out.|basic_html|Social Habit in Kernersville brings live music and performance to downtown's historic cocktail scene with open mic nights every Tuesday from 7 PM to 10 PM, featuring local musicians, singers, and performers in an intimate lounge setting. The venue regularly hosts jam sessions and live acoustic performances, creating a vibrant musical atmosphere that complements their expertly crafted cocktails. Musicians perform in a sophisticated yet welcoming 115-year-old building adorned with vintage couches, local artwork, and exposed brick walls that create perfect acoustics for intimate performances. The Tuesday open mics have become a staple for Kernersville's creative community, giving artists a platform to showcase their talents while patrons enjoy signature drinks like the Smoked Old Fashioned and Lavender Moon. Weekend live music performances typically run in the evening hours, featuring acoustic sets and small ensembles that enhance rather than overwhelm the lounge's conversation-friendly atmosphere. Founded by Mark Stamper as part of downtown Kernersville's renaissance, Social Habit has quickly established itself as a cultural hub where expertly mixed drinks and live entertainment come together to create memorable nights out.","36.122255732055|-80.070855864657||36.122255732055, -80.070855864657","Greg Stampfl & Bob Hensch",,"In person from 6pm",,48|node|15a5b21a-d77d-4e42-aadc-f9ed140fa2d0|/social-habit-bar-Kernersville-nc,"Social Habit",
