ively weekly events. One of the standout offerings is their Open Mic Night, which is regularly hosted on Sunday evenings. This recurring, free event gives local performers a welcoming stage to showcase any kind of talent, from music to comedy, making it a true platform for diverse artistic expression. They also host a separate Comedy Open Mic on Thursday evenings for stand-up fans. These nights underscore the brewery's commitment to entertainment, drawing crowds eager to support local acts while enjoying a quality pint. Ultimately, Clouds Brewing is more than just a brewery; it is a hub for community gatherings and emerging Raleigh talent.","35.821711540094|-78.612669851308||35.821711540094, -78.612669851308","Ocean / @fatsabrinacarpenter",,"In person",,50|node|682dc837-0ec0-46dd-839b-d9a11b065ebd|/clouds-brewing-tap-room,"Clouds Brewery & Taproom",
